{
  "_about": "Design tokens for reel (working name). Roles come from the recon (dark, dense pro-editor chrome). replica-brand swaps VALUES, never names. After any change: python contrast.py replica/design/tokens.json, then node replica/design/build-tokens.mjs to regenerate tokens.css.",
  "_notes": {
    "theme": "Dark only in v1. Video editors are judged on dark chrome and every competitor is dark. A light theme can be added later by adding a second color map with the same role names.",
    "accent": "CapCut's signature accent is a bright cyan. Recorded here only as the ROLE 'accent'. The value below is a neutral placeholder blue so the clone does not copy trade dress. replica-brand picks the real one.",
    "density": "UI text defaults to 12px (type.sm) like desktop NLEs. 11px (type.xs) is only for the timeline ruler, badges and timecode sub-labels."
  },
